  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, the equation of the line is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Case I: If both intercepts are positive<br />Then, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> No <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math> is possible (Discriminant is negative)<br />Case II: If intercept are of opposite sign, then <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;the distance of origin from the line is <math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>32</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units",
